        "tipo": "intro",
        "min": 2,
        "texto": "Today the seven trickiest letters arrive: the false friends. They look like letters of the English alphabet, but they have a different sound. «В» looks like a B, but sounds like V. «Н» looks like an H, but sounds like N. «Р» looks like a P, but sounds like R. «С» looks like a C, but sounds like S. «У» looks like a Y, but sounds like «oo». «Х» looks like an X, but it is a rough «kh» from the throat, like «ch» in Scottish «loch». And «Е» sounds like «ye». Golden rule: if a letter looks Latin, be suspicious and listen."
